  "description": "Pins the magic-less, sync-wire-only awareness frame (live-collab, decisions/sync/0655). A frame is a cleartext header room_id(16)||nonce(24)||version(1=0x01), then an XChaCha20-Poly1305+CTX seal over a canonical-JSON payload, with AAD aad_awareness_frame (role 'awareness-frame' | account_number_hash | optional 8-byte big-endian group_key_epoch for NTV6). Cases cover seal and open, a join and a presence frame, the NTV5 and NTV6 AAD forms, and the wrong-room / stale-epoch / tampered-tag negatives (each one non-distinguishing CannotDecrypt). The signed presence assertion's message-class prefix 'myne.awareness-presence v1|' is pinned by the assertion_message cases; the full sign/verify is pinned by the person-keypair category. Generated by `cargo test -p protocol --lib emit_awareness_frame_vectors_for_paste -- --ignored` (in protocol/src/awareness_frame.rs).",
